  "sourceHash": "90a4a75b82eeaa3cea24af959dbb6ecd043b1b2f090b963362acd4512f2bfeb1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "星熊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你臉色不大好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我沒事，只是在想事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......我沒想到他會被捲進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "沒事，你知道我的。過去的都過去了，用龍門話來說，這是命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "東國人也會信這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "經歷了這麼多事，即使我不信，現在也已經認了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "線報沒問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "準確無誤。這裡就是線報記載的位置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我們的目標，是那些鬼鬼祟祟的整合運動嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "看來他們沒發現我們，還不知道近衛局已經把他們徹底包圍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "似乎在圍繞著整座街區搭建著什麼的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不出意外的話，這裡是連接著整合運動各個據點的中心樞紐之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們摧毀這裡的通訊收發設施，可以狠狠地打擊整個區域內的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "這能增添我們最後反攻近衛局大樓的勝算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "都聽你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "而且，我也很在意情報線索的細節內容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你是說，整合運動在這兒活動，可不單單是想建個還算牢靠的據點，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你猜對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "“敵人正秘密尋找高價值目標，需優先確認其行動。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "他們在富人區幹些什麼？這能有什麼高價值目標？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我也覺得有問題。按照之前的計畫，這條街道上的任何建築都應當空無一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "如果整合運動是在預謀綁架誰，那他們可能沒機會抓住這位幸運市民了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我們什麼時候動手？整合運動似乎不喜歡佈置偵查小隊，我們隨時可以突襲他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "一直在做獵人，從來沒做過獵物吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "這時候成為獵物，馬上就會沒命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "還是先仔細觀察一下。我們要優先確認敵人的目的，卻不是要折騰他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "摧毀目標輕而易舉，想要瞭解敵人的目標卻需要我們的耐心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "等等！老陳，他們是不是想要破壞那棟宅子的大門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "已經確定了目標建築？快，整隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "要為市民減少點損失是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那是自然！狙擊手，待命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是龍門的軍隊！撤退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "聯絡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "狙擊手！射擊那個背著無線電台的傢伙！別讓他發訊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "明明該固守據點，第一反應居然是跑？肯定有鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "想跑就跑，跑得了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
